# eleventy-daisy overview

Static-site starter: **Eleventy 3 + Handlebars + Tailwind 4 + DaisyUI 5**, managed with **pnpm**.

- Source: `src/` → build output: `dist/`
- Partials: `src/_includes/` via `{{> category/name}}`
- Demo pages: `src/components/` (showcase partials; do not duplicate UI here)
- Content: `src/collections/**/*.md` tagged into `collections.<tag>`
- Theme entry: `src/assets/css/input.css`
- Full agent guide: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)

## Commands

- `pnpm start` — dev (Eleventy serve + Tailwind watch)
- `pnpm build` — production CSS + Eleventy

Prefer existing DaisyUI/Handlebars patterns. Do not switch SSG, templating, or CSS stack unless the user asks.
